  "expressionRuntimeVersion": "2",
  "description": "The public surface every port exposes beside evaluate (runtime 1.1.0). `evaluates` pins evaluates(typeUri): true exactly for the node classes the kernel folds itself (operators and literals); false for a binding (VarRef), a graph read (PropertyRead), a domain leaf, and an expression class only a host engine implements - a host checks an authored tree against it instead of probing evaluate. `matches` pins matches(input, pattern): the pinned RE2-compatible XSD-regex subset under fn:matches semantics, exactly as tx.Matches evaluates it (the cases are the v2 Matches vectors with a literal source); expectError marks a pattern outside the subset, which is a loud error.",
